      "2. Update Cloudflare DNS records (if external access needed)",
      "3. Update NPM proxy hosts (if traffic routed through NPM)",
      "4. Update PROXY_AUTH_WHITELIST in Mailu (if GCloud IP changed)",
      "5. Update WireGuard peer endpoints on all Oracle VMs (if GCloud IP changed)",
      "6. Update OCI Security List rules (if IP-restricted rules exist)",
      "7. Test connectivity: curl -sI https://<domain>",
      "8. DO NOT run iptables-restore - Docker manages iptables automatically"
    ]
